     "parts": [
      "recipe serves 4: 2 cans chickpeas, 1 can coconut milk, 1 onion, 3 garlic, 1 tbsp curry powder, 1 can diced tomatoes, spinach 2 cups. i want 10 servings for the week of grading. scale it + does coconut milk freeze ok"
     ]
