    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Chickpeas give ~11–12 g protein per serving at this scale, which is modest. Easy adds: serve with Greek yogurt on top (+8–10 g), cook in some paneer or tofu cubes (+10 g), or add a cup of red lentils with an extra cup of water (+5 g per serving and thicker sauce)."
     ]
    },
